{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":369,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":35510,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1407634,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":235778,"Name":"Starfish0512","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235778.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":215,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1298913113,"LastPoster":{"Id":285234,"Name":"CaymanKatie40","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285234.jpg?_r=1447621628","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":25,"Preview":{"Id":1407634,"PostDate":1298913113,"PostContent":"My FI and I have a trip planned to go to GC and check out a few locations for our May 2012 Weddi...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaunandstefanie@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295551451,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235778.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":215,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Starfish0512","Id":235778,"Name":"Starfish0512","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59942,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"263a538762ea5ac5a2183debfb3381f3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My FI and I have a trip planned to go to GC and check out a few locations for our May 2012 Wedding!&amp;nbsp; Anyone else getting married in the Cayman Islands?!&amp;nbsp; Please share details, vendors etc!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1407634,"PostDate":1298913113,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My FI and I have a trip planned to go to GC and check out a few locations for our May 2012 Wedding!\u00a0 Anyone else getting married in the Cayman Islands?!\u00a0 Please share details, vendors etc!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaunandstefanie@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295551451,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235778.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":215,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Starfish0512","Id":235778,"Name":"Starfish0512","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59942,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"660a8e36fe4fb7e0425e70cf1c555801","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; As Grand Cayman had been my runner up to my wedding destination (Turks &amp;amp; Caicos), I had checked out a few places. Then I was just there for vacation this past weekend and we ate at one of the places I had strongly considered for a reception, Luca. It&#039;s at the Caribbean Club, is on the beach and very classy. We had an excellent meal and great service, so I would consider that for a reception!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1413862,"PostDate":1299705563,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> As Grand Cayman had been my runner up to my wedding destination (Turks & Caicos), I had checked out a few places. Then I was just there for vacation this past weekend and we ate at one of the places I had strongly considered for a reception, Luca. It's at the Caribbean Club, is on the beach and very classy. We had an excellent meal and great service, so I would consider that for a reception!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandevillel@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1201409112,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208377.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lm3682","Id":208377,"Name":"lm3682","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59942,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"771b9d96b11beef811f8dd042dc70abe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are indeed going to the Carribean Club for a meeting.&amp;nbsp; I have heard such amazing reviews of the place!! Thanks for your feedback!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1415573,"PostDate":1299939986,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are indeed going to the Carribean Club for a meeting.\u00a0 I have heard such amazing reviews of the place!! Thanks for your feedback!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaunandstefanie@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295551451,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235778.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":215,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Starfish0512","Id":235778,"Name":"Starfish0512","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59942,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"acefc5200ffa4786d33774b32526ce4c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; When are you taking your meetings at the Caribbean Club and Luca?&amp;nbsp; We are booked there (site unseen!) for November 4, 2011.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve read a lot online and have been researching places for what feels like forever.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m thrilled with our choice, but would love to hear your first hand thoughts...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks, Laura&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1420476,"PostDate":1300683622,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> When are you taking your meetings at the Caribbean Club and Luca?\u00a0 We are booked there (site unseen!) for November 4, 2011.\u00a0 I've read a lot online and have been researching places for what feels like forever.\u00a0 I'm thrilled with our choice, but would love to hear your first hand thoughts...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks, Laura<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"segura.mueller@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1278754661,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230070.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ls415","Id":230070,"Name":"ls415","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59942,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d925e913ec1eccf906f1cf6eaf456fa3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m coming in on a cruiseship with my weddiing party and looking for a location on the beach for the ceremony.. I would love some suggestions as to what is the best location there.,,&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1423914,"PostDate":1301102234,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm coming in on a cruiseship with my weddiing party and looking for a location on the beach for the ceremony.. I would love some suggestions as to what is the best location there.,,<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lawtoya@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1301100741,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238176.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":110,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lawtoya","Id":238176,"Name":"lawtoya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59942,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf1b7f3da57c9e288ec92393c3faa100","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ls415[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n When are you taking your meetings at the Caribbean Club and Luca?  We are booked there (site unseen!) for November 4, 2011.  I&#039;ve read a lot online and have been researching places for what feels like forever.  I&#039;m thrilled with our choice, but would love to hear your first hand thoughts... \n \n Thanks, Laura[\/quote] \n \n \n Hi Laura!! \n \n So excited for you!!!  Even more so another Cayman bride :) We are heading down May 27-31st and meeting with the planner at Carribean Club first.  I&#039;ll be sure to let you know what I find! I have heard amazing reveiws, be sure to get some pictures for you too if you&#039;d like??","Attachments":[],"Id":1433763,"PostDate":1302652933,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ls415<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> When are you taking your meetings at the Caribbean Club and Luca?\u00a0 We are booked there (site unseen!) for November 4, 2011.\u00a0 I've read a lot online and have been researching places for what feels like forever.\u00a0 I'm thrilled with our choice, but would love to hear your first hand thoughts...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks, Laura<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Laura!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So excited for you!!!\u00a0 Even more so another Cayman bride <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> We are heading down May 27-31st and meeting with the planner at Carribean Club first.\u00a0 I'll be sure to let you know what I find! I have heard amazing reveiws, be sure to get some pictures for you too if you'd like??<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaunandstefanie@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295551451,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235778.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":215,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Starfish0512","Id":235778,"Name":"Starfish0512","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59942,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee5846ba404544f0069cb19473a00033","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]lawtoya[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I&#039;m coming in on a cruiseship with my weddiing party and looking for a location on the beach for the ceremony.. I would love some suggestions as to what is the best location there.,,[\/quote] \n \n \n Check out cyrstalblueweddings.com  I&#039;m sure that site will help you find a location!!!  It&#039;s been very helpful in all of my searching!","Attachments":[],"Id":1433765,"PostDate":1302652989,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>lawtoya<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I'm coming in on a cruiseship with my weddiing party and looking for a location on the beach for the ceremony.. I would love some suggestions as to what is the best location there.,,<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <br \/> Check out cyrstalblueweddings.com\u00a0 I'm sure that site will help you find a location!!!\u00a0 It's been very helpful in all of my searching!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaunandstefanie@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295551451,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235778.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":215,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Starfish0512","Id":235778,"Name":"Starfish0512","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59942,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3667bf15972c8552474e5fdc0b06458f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks Starfish.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;d love to see pics and any other intel you dig up &lt;span alt=\":mswink:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Everyone I&#039;ve worked with so far at Caribbean Club, Luca, and Celebrations has been lovely.&amp;nbsp; Good luck with whatever you choose!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1434499,"PostDate":1302757669,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks Starfish.\u00a0 I'd love to see pics and any other intel you dig up <span alt=\":mswink:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Everyone I've worked with so far at Caribbean Club, Luca, and Celebrations has been lovely.\u00a0 Good luck with whatever you choose!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"segura.mueller@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1278754661,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230070.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ls415","Id":230070,"Name":"ls415","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59942,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee6815f4bdaae112f79eb9d128eeda6a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am getting married at the Grand Cayman Beach Suites on June 24th 2011.&amp;nbsp; Marina Flynn the wedding coordinator has been awesome to work with.&amp;nbsp; We have 30 people attending our wedding.&amp;nbsp; Beach wedding with cocktail hour at the terrace and then the reception at the pool terrace area.&amp;nbsp; Mainstream will be playing.&amp;nbsp; Steel Drum for the ceremony.&amp;nbsp; Celebrations doing the decorating and flowers.&amp;nbsp; Everything has been smooth thus far.&amp;nbsp; I will post pictures after.&amp;nbsp; PictureThis is our Photographer.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1437985,"PostDate":1303330520,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am getting married at the Grand Cayman Beach Suites on June 24th 2011.\u00a0 Marina Flynn the wedding coordinator has been awesome to work with.\u00a0 We have 30 people attending our wedding.\u00a0 Beach wedding with cocktail hour at the terrace and then the reception at the pool terrace area.\u00a0 Mainstream will be playing.\u00a0 Steel Drum for the ceremony.\u00a0 Celebrations doing the decorating and flowers.\u00a0 Everything has been smooth thus far.\u00a0 I will post pictures after.\u00a0 PictureThis is our Photographer.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cyndi_harrison@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1303325905,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239091.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":130,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GrandCayBride","Id":239091,"Name":"GrandCayBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59942,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"688f073b404476258ff5f6cb15f0230e","RawContent":"Grand Cay Bride... \n \n I am thrilled you found this thread! GCBS is looking like the spot for us as we are having a small number of family traveling down with us and not sure we can fill the requirements for the Carribean Club.  I have been in touch with Marina a number of times and she seems delightful! We will be meeting with her during our little whirlwind trip as well!! Cant wait to hear how everything turns out for you!!  \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]GrandCayBride[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I am getting married at the Grand Cayman Beach Suites on June 24th 2011.  Marina Flynn the wedding coordinator has been awesome to work with.  We have 30 people attending our wedding.  Beach wedding with cocktail hour at the terrace and then the reception at the pool terrace area.  Mainstream will be playing.  Steel Drum for the ceremony.  Celebrations doing the decorating and flowers.  Everything has been smooth thus far.  I will post pictures after.  PictureThis is our Photographer.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1438502,"PostDate":1303402869,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Grand Cay Bride...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am thrilled you found this thread! GCBS is looking like the spot for us as we are having a small number of\u00a0family traveling down with us and not sure we can fill the requirements for the Carribean Club.\u00a0\u00a0I have been in touch with Marina a number of times and she seems delightful! We will be meeting with her during our little whirlwind trip as well!!\u00a0Cant wait to hear how everything turns out for you!! \u00a0<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>GrandCayBride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I am getting married at the Grand Cayman Beach Suites on June 24th 2011.\u00a0 Marina Flynn the wedding coordinator has been awesome to work with.\u00a0 We have 30 people attending our wedding.\u00a0 Beach wedding with cocktail hour at the terrace and then the reception at the pool terrace area.\u00a0 Mainstream will be playing.\u00a0 Steel Drum for the ceremony.\u00a0 Celebrations doing the decorating and flowers.\u00a0 Everything has been smooth thus far.\u00a0 I will post pictures after.\u00a0 PictureThis is our Photographer.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaunandstefanie@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295551451,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235778.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":215,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Starfish0512","Id":235778,"Name":"Starfish0512","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"59942","Title":"Updated Grand Cayman Weddings Thread","LastPostDate":1446575973},"Pages":{"TotalItems":369,"TotalPages":37,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":360},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
